## Why This Is Asked
Evaluate ability to design safe multi-region rollout with deterministic routing and robust rollback mechanisms.

## Key Concepts
- Deterministic routing via consistent hashing
- Region-aware feature weighting and versioning
- Comprehensive observability and rollback criteria
- Data-plane safety and auditability

## Code Example
```javascript
// JavaScript example: deterministic bucketing by user_id
function bucket(userId, buckets) {
  let h = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < userId.length; i++) h = (h * 31 + userId.charCodeAt(i)) >>> 0;
  return h % buckets;
}
```

